      "name": "Three-Limbed Lunge",
      "category": "action",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "action",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": "◆"
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The saurian warmonger makes three Strikes: one Strike each with the weapons in their hands and one Strike with their tail. They can perform these attacks in any order, though each counts toward their multiple attack penalty as normal. After making a Three-Limbed Lunge, the warmonger is flat-footed until the beginning of their next turn."
      ]
